---
description: Require explicit user consent before creating or deleting Cloudflare or account resources
alwaysApply: true
---

# Create and delete need consent

Do not create or delete Cloudflare resources, secrets, DNS records, Access apps/policies, Workers, or other account objects unless the user has explicitly approved that specific create or delete.

Updating an existing setting is allowed when it is required to fix the current issue. Prefer updating what already exists over adding something new.

If a create or delete is necessary, describe exactly what would be added or removed and wait for approval.
